    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">a
    representation that the stockholder is a record holder of the Company&#8217;s securities entitled to vote at the meeting upon such
    nomination and intends to appear in person or by proxy at the meeting to propose such nomination;</span></td></tr>
  <tr style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
